So, let's say I have a poster about moving towards the future...

Forever towards the future.

What is the best form for this to take? what style should the visuals have? what typography is best?

Futurists were about speed and acknowledging the future and dismantling or leaving behind the past. But, if I choose to make this look "futurist" do I accidentally also make it about their racism and misogyny?
